Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:44.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《侏罗纪公园3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:51.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（索拿岛 哥斯达黎加西方207英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:54.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁区）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,都准备好了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能开得越近越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you get as close as you can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好的话 另外有赏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you something extra if you make it a good trip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.23,0:01:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽量的 但不能太近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you close, my friend, but not too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则会被吃掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to be eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready, amigo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恐龙飞伞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 宾 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric! Ben!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怕 好刺激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh, this is great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See anything yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧点 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇静点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要撞上了！- 不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna crash! We're gonna crash! - No, we're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我先松绑 好放掉绳索 - 我们要撞上了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna cut this loose! Let go of the rope! - We're gonna crash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,手拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.35,0:03:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿开 快一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay, bud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是草食恐龙 所以不会互相攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, those are herbivores.They wouldn't be interested in fighting each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是肉食恐龙 它们才喜欢互相蚕食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these are carnivores, and they really like fighting with each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们用牙和爪子 去撕裂对方的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use their teeth and claws to rip each other's throats out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿伦 他才三岁 等五岁再教吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan, he's three. Let's wait till he's five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 抱歉啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Sorry, Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾丽 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ellie. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是汤姆 他要和你谈最后一章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Tom again. He has to talk to you about the last chapter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我一定要引用杰克霍纳的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell him I'm not gonna lose the Jack Horner quote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的编辑认为他是古生物学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My editor thinks he's a paleontologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克 你看看是谁来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mark. Hey, babe, look who's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是阿伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Nice to meet you, Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 这是草食恐龙 他是恐龙先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, this's a herbivore and that's the dinosaur man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinosaur man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我叫什么 是阿伦吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, say my name. Is my name Alan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我名字是阿伦吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my name Alan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它本来知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤心吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝咖啡 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克现在在国务院做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know Mark's working for the State Department now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,做哪方面的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What do you do, Mark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际关系 多半是法律协定之类的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}International relations, mostly treaty law and things like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小家伙在抗议了 - 我去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call of the wild one. - Here, I'll get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好好聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys…catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a great guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你都在研究什么？- 以迅猛龙为主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what are you working on now? - Raptors, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的主题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得它们的声音吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the sounds they made?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量不去想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去我们对它们智慧和能力的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, all our theories about raptor intelligence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,评估相当不正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they're capable of we weren't even close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快告诉我 - 我们做过头盖骨化石的扫描{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me. - We did cranium scans of a fossil skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了一个精密的共鸣腔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found what looks like a very sophisticated resonating chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 所以当初我们说它们能发声是正确的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we were right? They had the ability to vocalize?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信这是它们群居的关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm convinced that's the key to their social intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也解释了它们的团队行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which explains why they could work together as a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,能协调攻击 而不让被捕食者发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And coordinate their attacks so the prey wouldn't know what was going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能互相交谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could talk to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且已超出我们的想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a degree we never imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们很聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, they were smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,比海豚 鲸鱼更聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were smarter than dolphins or whales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至比灵长类还要聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were smarter than primates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说如果你需要帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say, if you ever need help with anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you forget to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管打电话来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何时间 任何事都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything, anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍是最杰出的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真心话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我是仅存的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of my breed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过多重的前腔研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the painstaking study of the anterior chamber in multiple specimens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确定了上颚和喉头的关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can determine the exciting correlation between the upper palate and the larynx.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,依此推断 注意这是推断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This lets us theorize… theorize, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙是可以发声的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}mind you that the raptor was capable of sophisticated vocalizations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,由此可见这是一个巨大的进化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would have been a tremendous evolutionary advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙它凶猛 聪明而且有社交能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raptors were fierce, intelligent and socially sophisticated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道分组出去猎食 并且能互相协调{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were able to hunt in numbers… and coordinate their efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是洪水使它们绝迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were it not for the cataclysmic events which overtook them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今控制地球生物的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's entirely possible that raptors rather than…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能不是人类 而是迅猛龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}humans would have become the dominant species on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这能引起你们的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope this has been of interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为古生物学者 这个发现着实让人兴奋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It certainly excites us as paleontologists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有许多东西有待发掘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. There's much, much more to discover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我们不断的请求你们的支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why we continue to need and ask for your support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢 格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much, Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, does anyone have a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有和侏罗纪公园无关的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have a question that does not relate to Jurassic Park?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是和我未参与的圣地亚哥事件无关的问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the incident in San Diego…which I did not witness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙的理论很好 但都是猜测 是不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your theory on raptors is good and all, but isn't all this conjecture moot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦联合国和哥斯达黎加决定如何处置第二个岛屿后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the U.N. and Costa Rica and everyone decides how to handle that second island, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学家一定会自行进入寻求线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}scientists will just go in and look for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙生存在六千五百万年前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinosaurs lived 65 million years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今都已变成化石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is left of them is fossilized in the rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:09:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以真正的发现是从岩石中得来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is in the rock that real scientists make real discoveries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉蒙和遗传国际公司所做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what John Hammond and Ingen did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在侏罗纪公园内 以基因制造出巨兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Jurassic Park…is create genetically engineered theme park monsters, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing more and nothing less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说即使有机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that you wouldn't want to get onto Isla Sorna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不会到索拿岛去做研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and study them, if you had the chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何力量能让我去那个岛屿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No force on Earth or heaven could get me on that island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈许 都有什么武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what we got here, Nashy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,20毫米铁角龙是半自动瓦斯操作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron horn 20-millimeter, gas-operated, semiautomatic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,十发旋转子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ten-shot magazine, rotating bolt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,减低后座力的枪支 烈性炸药 燃烧弹…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}recoil-reducing muzzle break, high explosive incendiary…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是余戴斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Udesky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是保罗 刚检查…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Udesky, this is Paul Kirby. Just checking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们这里已经准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, sir. We're good to go here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等钱一付 一切就搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, I can lock things down just as soon as you drop me that payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 这两个是最好的人选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's right. Two of the very best men I could possibly find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和他们一起工作过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you worked with these men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然没有一起工作过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, I haven't worked with them personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但介绍人极力推荐他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, believe me, sir, both of these men come very highly recommended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 你放心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to worry about, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定能轻松的达成任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a walk in the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:41.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蒙大拿州 峰垒湖）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 我的方法可能不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, I don't think I'm doing this right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,用牙刷试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try the toothbrush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to go slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take a little bit at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老分不清岩石和骨头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never tell what's rock and what's bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实都是岩石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, it's all rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过骨头里的钙被石化而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The calcium in the bones is replaced during fossilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以感到它们的不同 你瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can feel the difference. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,粗糙 光滑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough… smooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,粗糙 光滑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough, smooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:25.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（洛矶山博物馆古生物学部门）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brennan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有收获吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还来得及改变主修科目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not too late to change your major, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不太好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很糟 我们只剩四个礼拜的经费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse. We're gonna have to pack up in four weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个礼拜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我租了一些设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to rent equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, I gotta show you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢电脑 对不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like computers, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还喜欢算盘呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the abacus, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是古生物学的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the future of paleontology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是快速原型机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rapid prototyper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把迅猛龙头骨资料输入进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enter in the scan data from the raptor's skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑把它分成上千的切片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The computer breaks it down into thousands of slices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后这个设备就开始造型 一次一层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this thing sculpts it, one layer at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:08.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（原型完成）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是迅猛龙的共鸣腔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you the resonating chamber of a Velociraptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太高明了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. This is brilliant, Billy. Really, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可惜晚了点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad to say, it's just a little bit late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克比企业公司的保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul Kirby. Kirby Enterprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的名片 比利 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my card. How you doing, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能为你效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you, Mr. Kirby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我非常崇拜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, first thing, I 'm a great admirer of yours, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 有个建议想和你讨论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have a proposition I'd like to discuss with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你赏光今晚和我们共进晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have dinner with my wife and me this evening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我请客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be our treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的好意 我才旅行回来 很累{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that'd be great, but I'm tired. I've been traveling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,改天吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe some other time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这很值得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, this will be worth your while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这么说定 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'd love to. - Oh, terrific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我最欣赏这种精神 - 那就今晚见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the spirit. Good. - This evening then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格兰特博士 比利 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Billy. Dr. Grant. - How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达 比利 - 克比太太 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda, Billy. - Mrs. Kirby, how are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要喝什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you boys drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冰钻鸡尾酒 - 来两杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ice Pick, Catfish. - Two, please, Cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很崇拜你的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've admired your work for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常具有启发性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really truly inspiring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达和我很喜爱户外生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda and I just love the outdoors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎参加过所有的探险团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck, we've been on just about every adventure tour they can come up with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,象尼罗河 加拉帕哥斯群岛 喀喇昆仑山脉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nile, Galapagos, K2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至预订月球首航之旅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We even have two seats reserved on the first commercial flight to the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:14:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在我们结婚纪念那天 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for our wedding anniversary this year…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,想做点特别的活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we wanted to do something really special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那种 - 一生难忘的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something So… - Once in a lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们包了一架飞机 到索拿岛去探险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've chartered an airplane to fly us over Isla Sorna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你做我们的向导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'd like you to be our guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的赏识 可是我很忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a very kind offer, Mr. Kirby, but I'm a very, very busy man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过倒可以介绍几个 非常合格的人给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can recommend a couple of guys who are really highly qualified that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你曾亲眼看过它们 所以最合适{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You're the best. You've seen these animals in the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至曾和它们面对面过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one that even comes close to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但依规定不能低飞 所以你根本看不到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't be able to fly low enough to see anything of any real interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,妙在他们特许我们低飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, see? That's the interesting part…because we have permission to fly low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,多低？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How low?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是飞航专家 但我知道比任何人都低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no aviation expert, but a heck of a lot lower than anybody else, I can tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知 要多低都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I understand, it's pretty much. It's whatever we want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hard to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的公司 所经营的进出口业务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, through my business dealings…import, export, emerging markets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我结交了不少高层朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made a lot of friends in high places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:15:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,连哥斯达黎加的政府也不例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this case, the Costa Rican government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的参与对我们非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, you have no idea how important it is to us that you come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是成功的关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would make all the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Kirby, I-I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也愿意捐款支持你的研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, we'd love to make a contribution to your research here. So{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何数目都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could write all kinds of numbers on this check, Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多少钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's it gonna take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我付你的钱不少 买个好点的袋子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with what I pay you, couldn't you afford a better bag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.59,0:15:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的幸运袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. This one's lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前和朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple years ago, some buddies and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到新西兰的峭壁上做滑翔飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}went hang gliding off these cliffs in New Zealand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上升气流突然把我扫到一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this big updraft came and swept me right against the side, wham!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那的确很幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that does sound lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这条背带救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This strap alone saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我跌落时它刚好钩在岩石上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got hooked on a rock as I was falling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟达尔文进化论刚好相反 「愚者生存」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverse Darwinism: survival of the most idiotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你给我这次机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan, I want to thank you for bringing me along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正回来后骨头仍然在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the bones will still be there when we get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究骨头的好处就是它跑不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the great thing about bones: They never run away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初是你把我扯进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is, you got me into this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我绝不会放过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have no intention of being on my own with these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太兴奋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get too excited, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能什么也看不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chances are we won't see a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 到时候拜托叫醒我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn to be nice. Wake me when we get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认识克比的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do you know the Kirbys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在教堂认识的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, through our church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 我们快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是圣胡安 一架不明飞机正接近索拿岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified aircraft approaching Isla Sorna, this is San Juan Approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在禁区飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're flying in restricted airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请尽快回头…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immediately turn to coordinates two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 我几乎都忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, I'd forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们终于到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it, honey. We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,古伯 如果看到什么就大叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooper, if you see anything, yell up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说不准叫吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I thought I'd keep it to myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 从左边看过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Everyone, if you look out the left of the plane, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会看到成群的腕龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can see a whole herd of brachiosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,雄性首领走在队伍的最前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you can see in the front of the group, the alpha male grazing there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,余戴斯 奈许 前面有东西吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Udesky, Nash, how 'bout up front? You guys see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing yet, Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这边看过去是一群三角龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean… Mrs. Kirby, look. Out here you'll see a group of triceratops{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有跑道 要降落吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kirby, we have a landing strip up ahead. You want me to put it down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 先绕全岛一圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I told you, I want to circle first, see the whole island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思 不能在这里降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean set it down? You can't land here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 等一下 我可以解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - Hold on. I can explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不能在这岛上降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot land on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 你不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be fine. You just don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯啦 - 拜托坐下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? - Sit down, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士 请你先坐下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, will you please sit down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 我们没降落吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, tell me we didn't land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 宾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric? Eric? Ben? Eric?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们似乎在找人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're looking for someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 抱歉我们打…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dr. Grant, are you all right? I'm sorry we had to be so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁打我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hit me? Who hit me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是古伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be Cooper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理四周 使这里更安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're setting up a perimeter to make the place safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这里没有安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are good. On this island, there is no such thing as safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好回到飞机上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get back on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你太太别叫了 这样太危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you tell your wife to stop making that noise? That is a very, very bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达宝贝 格兰特博士说 那样很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben? Amanda? Honey? Dr. Grant said that's a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说太危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's a bad idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a bad idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是霸王龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a tyrannosaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 比霸王龙还要大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. It sounds bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.86,0:20:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to leave! We have to leave now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到飞机上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外那个人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the other guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,古伯能保护自己的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooper's a professional. He can handle himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the plane! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 我们不能 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul, we can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们只绕着岛飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. We'll just circle the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand, Udesky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他想干什么 - 那是古伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - That's Cooper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coop, get out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't stop this plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料被切断 我们要坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel cut off! We're going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.97,0:22:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家别乱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone just stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.97,0:22:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫圣胡安 请求援助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Juan Approach, Mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有卫星电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has the satellite phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.98,0:22:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电通话器坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting anything. The radio's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.49,0:22:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没着陆呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't landed yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.99,0:23:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有线路都在忙线中 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All circuits are busy. Damn it! Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep still! Keep still! What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.01,0:23:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么 抓稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.10,0:24:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比太太 快回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Kirby, come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.60,0:24:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我 往这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me! This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.19,0:26:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该甩掉它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.70,0:26:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 是死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.70,0:26:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都不准动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move a muscle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.50,0:27:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你别打了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Please, please don't. Stop, p-please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.51,0:27:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好给我个解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time you did some explaining, Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.01,0:27:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们求过所有的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.01,0:27:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,试过所有办法 根本没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did everything we could. No one would help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.51,0:27:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯达黎加政府说这里是禁止飞行区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Costa Rican government said this is a no-fly zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.02,0:27:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国大使馆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The U.S. Embassy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.02,0:27:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己的大使馆 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's our U.S. Embassy told us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.17,0:27:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然叫我们接受事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should accept the inevitable. Can you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.02,0:28:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎能让12岁小孩单独飞拖曳伞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let a 12-year-old go parasailing alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.03,0:28:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.03,0:28:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我朋友一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't alone. He was with a friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.03,0:28:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是宾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben Hildebrand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.03,0:28:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和保罗一年前离婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul and I divorced over a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.53,0:28:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么找我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.03,0:28:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说需要找曾到过岛上的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said we needed someone who'd been on the island before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我没叫你去绑架呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I did not tell you to kidnap somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.54,0:28:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没来过这座岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never been on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.04,0:28:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你书都写了 怎么会没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you have. You wrote that book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.55,0:28:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是努布拉岛 这是索拿岛 B地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Isla Nublar. This is Isla Sorna, site "B."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.05,0:28:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个不同的恐龙岛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean there are two islands with dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.05,0:28:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没你的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay out of this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.05,0:28:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们失踪多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long have they been missing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.56,0:28:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个星期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.56,0:28:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,将近八个星期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost eight weeks now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 我们到飞机里尽量多拿点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy. We go back to the plane and salvage what we can, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.06,0:28:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就朝海边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we make for the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.07,0:28:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士 找不到儿子我们绝不离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, we're not leaving this island without our son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以自己去找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you can go and look for him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.57,0:28:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就跟着我们 不准生事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can stick with us as long as you don't hold us up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.57,0:28:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头来… 恐怕还是死路一条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way… you probably won't get off this island alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.59,0:29:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.09,0:29:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍旧去寻找你儿子 但和他们走同一个方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We search for your son…in the direction that they're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.60,0:29:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent. Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.13,0:29:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.13,0:29:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是没看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing you haven't seen before, Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瘦了多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much weight did you say you lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.14,0:29:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约25磅 因为我常游泳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 25 pounds. I've been swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.64,0:30:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讨厌游泳 而且根本不会游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swimming? You hate to swim. You don't even know how to swim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.15,0:30:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是特别去学的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.15,0:30:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看起来很棒 - 你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look good. - So do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.65,0:30:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么归类？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you classify it, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.16,0:30:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是超级肉食性恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a superpredator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.66,0:30:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼻子长长的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suchimimus. Snout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.67,0:30:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要再大些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, think bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.17,0:30:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是重爪龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baryonyx?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.17,0:30:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,重爪龙没有鳍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with that sail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.17,0:30:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是棘背龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spinosaurus Aegypticus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.68,0:30:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它并不在遗传国际公司的目录内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember that on Ingen's list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.68,0:30:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然不在目录内 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it wasn't on their list, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.35,0:30:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们可能还搞了其它名堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that makes me wonder what else they were up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.69,0:30:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比 告诉我 当你攀登昆仑山时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Kirby. Tell me when you climbed K2, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.24,0:30:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地是设在两万五还是三万尺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you base camp at 25 or 30, 000 feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,三万尺 非常接近山顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty thousand feet. We were close to the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.21,0:31:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那比实际山高还超出一千尺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were about a thousand feet above it, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.71,0:31:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很常见的错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, that's a common mistake. Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.21,0:31:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有克比企业 是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as Kirby Enterprises, is there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.22,0:31:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克比油漆地砖及其它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Kirby Paint and Tile Plus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓其它是指浴室设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plus stands for bathroom fixtures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.22,0:31:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在俄克拉荷马州的西门购物中心内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the Westgate Shopping Center, Enid, Oklahoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.23,0:31:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来那张支票也不能兑现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I don't suppose that check you wrote us is any good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.73,0:31:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会付你的 没问题的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good. This is good. I will pay you, no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.73,0:31:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们身处绝境 居然还被耍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are in the worse place in the world, and we're not even being paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.74,0:31:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别生气 这样好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait, fellas. Hold on. I'll make this up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.24,0:31:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来你想装修浴室或厨房…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever do a bathroom or a kitchen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不是什么雇佣兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not really a mercenary, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.25,0:31:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没这么说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never said I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.75,0:31:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.25,0:31:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是干什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.25,0:31:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是中介人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm like a booking agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.75,0:31:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人生病不能来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the guys got sick and couldn't come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.76,0:31:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 让我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.26,0:31:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开五金店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you run a hardware store?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:31:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是油漆和地砖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paint and tile. Yeah. Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.26,0:32:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,人不可貌相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never can tell about people, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.76,0:32:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.27,0:32:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾瑞克 - 不要叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eric? - Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.27,0:32:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别叫 格兰特博士说这里很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you stop that? Dr. Grant says this is very dangerous territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.77,0:32:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该分两路 才能找更多的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should split up or something. We could cover twice as much ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.28,0:32:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士说那样不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant says that's a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.98,0:32:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是格兰特博士说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dr. Grant says…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.78,0:32:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然雇了专家 为什么不听他的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the good of hiring an expert if we're not gonna use his advice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.78,0:32:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他不找艾瑞克 而是找海边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except Dr. Grant isn't looking for Eric. He's looking for the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.29,0:32:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就去喊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine. Go ahead and scream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.29,0:32:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等那支三什么龙攻击你时 别哭着来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when that tricycloplots attacks you, don't come crying to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.29,0:32:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用你费心 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't worry about that. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.29,0:32:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么 - 你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. Never mind. - What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.30,0:32:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 别啰唆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say? God, Paul, just drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.30,0:32:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果分开走 我要和你们一组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we split up, I'm going with you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.33,0:32:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.33,0:32:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比先生和克比太太{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. and Mrs. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.33,0:32:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在附近的可能性很低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Kirby, the chances are remote they're still in the vicinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.34,0:33:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艾瑞克的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young adult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.85,0:33:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.35,0:33:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的摄影机 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my camera. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.86,0:33:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The battery's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.36,0:33:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.37,0:33:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄影机给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have the camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.37,0:33:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you on that one, Ma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.87,0:33:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 俯冲 俯冲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, dive, dive. Okay, diving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.88,0:33:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈 你应该接住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ma! You were supposed to catch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.38,0:33:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他失踪那天拍的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot this the morning they disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.89,0:33:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 让我拿 给我嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I want that. Let me take that. Come on, give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.39,0:33:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See anything yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.89,0:33:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.40,0:34:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把夹子打开 还有个大钩子 我看不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unclip us. There's a big clip. I can't see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.40,0:34:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.41,0:34:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先把你松开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna unhook you, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.41,0:34:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.91,0:34:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我现在下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, buddy? I'm gonna drop myself down now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄影机还在拍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The camera's still on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.42,0:34:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道他还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive. I know he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.42,0:34:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.93,0:34:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能飞那家伙吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fly one of those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.93,0:34:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要伞没坏 应该可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, as long as the sail's not torn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.94,0:34:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把它拿下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.94,0:34:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有飞机经过 这该能引起驾驶员的注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we spot a plane, it might be a good way to get attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.44,0:34:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,向这边拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it over this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.95,0:34:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it. I'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.95,0:34:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.46,0:35:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 全拿掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, you're free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.97,0:35:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比 把她追回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her back, Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.97,0:35:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.48,0:35:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.49,0:35:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达 你停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda, stop, stop, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.50,0:35:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,宾的事我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry about Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和宾无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Ben, Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Eric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.51,0:35:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一个人孤军奋斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out there all by himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.01,0:35:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.51,0:35:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子一个人在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our baby's out here all by himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:36:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证我们一定会找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. We'll find him. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.03,0:36:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.53,0:36:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.54,0:36:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快来看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should come look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.07,0:36:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raptor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.08,0:37:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听着 我们一定会找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find him. You listening to me? We're gonna find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.09,0:37:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子有小聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid's got resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.59,0:37:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得以前我们罚他禁足 他却花招百出吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what it was like to try to ground him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.59,0:37:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.10,0:37:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.10,0:37:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在拍鸟巢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was photographing the nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.61,0:37:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.11,0:37:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.11,0:37:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果失去你 叫我怎么和那些人相处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we lose you, it's just me and the damn tourists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.12,0:37:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克一定在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you Eric's in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.13,0:37:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌最后一块钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think? I'd bet my bottom dollar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.13,0:37:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.13,0:37:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说它是五星级酒店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned, it's the Four Seasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.67,0:38:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.17,0:38:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul, don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.18,0:38:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌个运气吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能换零钱 它只收两毛五的铜板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got some change? It only takes quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.20,0:39:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一块十分钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got, like…I got a buck ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.76,0:40:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们制造恐龙的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how you make dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.76,0:40:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是扮演上帝的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is how you play God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.82,0:41:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.33,0:41:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.34,0:41:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! This way! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.85,0:41:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Over here! Hey! Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.36,0:41:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,推{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.87,0:41:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.88,0:42:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在向同伴求救{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's calling for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.88,0:42:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.88,0:42:07.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（遗传国际公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.40,0:42:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝草食龙群里跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head to the herd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.93,0:42:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,到树上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for the trees!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.46,0:43:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,余戴斯呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Udesky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.98,0:43:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kirby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.99,0:43:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.99,0:43:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿伦和你在一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Alan with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.50,0:43:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.50,0:44:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,余戴斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Udesky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,余戴斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Udesky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.50,0:44:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.51,0:44:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, no, he's not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.01,0:44:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 似乎不对劲 - 我们得去帮他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, wait! Something's not right. - We gotta help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.51,0:44:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.52,0:44:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.03,0:44:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,圈套 它们居然设下圈套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They set a trap. They actually set a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.04,0:44:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.54,0:44:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在找什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.61,0:45:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.63,0:46:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.63,0:46:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 真谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot, Eric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.14,0:46:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.14,0:46:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你父母也到这里找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Your parents are here. They're looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.64,0:46:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.15,0:46:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.65,0:46:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 他们在一起就吵架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good. They don't do so well together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.65,0:46:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了找你 他们相处得还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised what people can do when they have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.67,0:46:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是阿伦·格兰特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Alan Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.68,0:46:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.18,0:47:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母… 邀我一起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents, uh, invited me along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.71,0:47:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的两本书我都看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read both of your books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.71,0:47:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢第一本写你在岛上的书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked the first one more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.72,0:47:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前你蛮喜欢恐龙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you were on the island. You liked dinosaurs back then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.22,0:47:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前它们并没有要吃我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back then they hadn't tried to eat me yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.72,0:47:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们搬走时留下不少东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Ingen cleared out, they left a lot of stuff behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.23,0:47:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有武器吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.67,0:47:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了 我用了最后一个瓦斯弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. And I just used the last of the gas grenades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.73,0:47:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I appreciate that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.24,0:48:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点 那是霸王龙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful with that. T-rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.74,0:48:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把小的恐龙吓跑 却会吸引更大的来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scares the smaller ones, but attracts one really big one with a fin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.74,0:48:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是霸王龙的尿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is T-rex pee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.25,0:48:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么弄来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.75,0:48:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不知道的好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.26,0:48:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要甜点吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dessert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.26,0:48:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.77,0:48:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能在岛上活八周 真的让我很惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric, I have to tell you, I'm astonished that you've lasted eight weeks on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.27,0:48:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,才过了八个星期吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all it's been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.27,0:48:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive, and that's the important thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.28,0:48:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好有你 否则我必死无疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks to you, that's one thing that we have in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.78,0:48:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过马尔科姆博士的书吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you read Malcolm's book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.79,0:48:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.29,0:48:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.79,0:48:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很唠叨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know. I mean, it was kind of preachy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.29,0:48:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且乱成一团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And too much chaos. Everything's chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.30,0:49:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎自以为高人一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed like the guy was kind of high on himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深有同感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two things that we have in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.31,0:49:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.81,0:49:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是秀颌龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.33,0:49:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.83,0:49:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.34,0:49:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:50:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 这不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how this turns out, it wasn't your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.36,0:50:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克是个意志坚强的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric's always been a strong-willed kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.86,0:50:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.87,0:50:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来你把宾给扯进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you throw someone like Ben Hilde brand into the mix{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.37,0:50:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.35,0:50:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那是」什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Well" what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.88,0:50:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说这不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying…It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.88,0:50:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 如果他和你一起 就不会出事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, if he'd been with you, he'd be completely safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.39,0:50:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车永远低于最高限速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive five miles under the speed limit, Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.89,0:50:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我三年中撞毁了三辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've totaled three cars in three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.39,0:50:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是三辆 别克车并没有全毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not three. The Buick wasn't really totaled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.40,0:50:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那样说是因为 我想买新的多功能运动车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said it was 'cause I wanted to get the S.U.V.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.41,0:50:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起要你来这里受罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry that you have to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.91,0:50:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒不觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.49,0:52:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在堤岸边有条船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there's a boat right alongside the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.49,0:52:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来还能开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks in good shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.50,0:52:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是援救船吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.00,0:52:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.50,0:52:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前留下来的船 至少它能浮起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just something left behind. But it floats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.51,0:52:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们依计行事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stick to the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.02,0:52:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝海边出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head to the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.52,0:52:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不去找格兰特博士吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna look for Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.52,0:52:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到海岸去是他的主意 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going to the coast was Alan's idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.82,0:52:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他活着 一定会朝那边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's alive, that's where he's headed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.02,0:52:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.03,0:52:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那艾瑞克呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Eric?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.03,0:52:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很聪明 应该想到海边的机会比较大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric's a smart kid. He probably knows he stands his best chance by the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.03,0:52:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且大恐龙都集中在岛中间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He figures all the big dinosaurs are in the center of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.53,0:52:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.04,0:53:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.05,0:53:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.05,0:53:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙的爪子 我以前也有一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a raptor claw. Used to have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.05,0:53:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是化石的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fossil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.55,0:53:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的是新鲜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine is new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.56,0:53:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛上你已经探勘过多少地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much of the island did you explore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.56,0:53:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直留在这附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stayed pretty close to the compound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.56,0:53:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想如果有人找我 一定会来这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured if anyone came looking for me, that's where they'd start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.07,0:53:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的计划是到海边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get to the coast. That was the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.57,0:53:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定 离水越近恐龙越大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure? Closer you get to the water, the bigger things get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.07,0:53:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能下到峡谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we can find our way down into the canyon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.07,0:53:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能沿着河到海边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could follow the river out to the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.58,0:53:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去找你的父母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we find your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.58,0:53:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步一步来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One step at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.08,0:53:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.09,0:53:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.59,0:53:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我老爸的卫星电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dad's satellite phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.59,0:53:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute! How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.60,0:54:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,西门中心的克比油漆和地砖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirby Paint and Tile Plus, in Westgate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.10,0:54:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.10,0:54:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.12,0:54:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric! Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.13,0:54:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric! This way! Eric! Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.13,0:54:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.13,0:54:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric! Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.64,0:54:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Dad! Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.15,0:54:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道能找到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it! My God! I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.16,0:55:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴看到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.16,0:55:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拣到我的袋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got my bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.16,0:55:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有幸运的背带啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Lucky strap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.67,0:55:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我拿好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to carry it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.67,0:55:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要找个缺口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a gap here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.17,0:55:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们在这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know we were here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.17,0:55:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到电话铃响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phone. That stupid jingle from the store, I heard it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.18,0:55:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.68,0:55:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的卫星电话在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, your satellite phone. Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.68,0:55:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.18,0:55:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后在哪里用它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you use it last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.18,0:55:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.19,0:55:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在飞机上我接了一通电话… - 后来呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got a call on the plane, and… - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.19,0:55:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦 我借给奈许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What! I loaned it to Nash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.19,0:55:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说当他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've had it when he…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.21,0:55:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.27,0:56:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把袋子给我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan, you wanna give me the bag back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.27,0:56:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿着没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, Billy, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.78,0:56:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你还给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please give me the bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.29,0:57:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迅猛龙的蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raptor eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.80,0:57:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷了迅猛龙的蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you steal raptor eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.81,0:57:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it all makes sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.31,0:57:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓当初没想到 你会捡到我的袋子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear… if I'd known that you were gonna end up with them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.81,0:57:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的是一时冲动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took 'em on an impulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.32,0:57:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想到它价值高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they'd be worth a fortune, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.95,0:57:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少能换得十年的研究基金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough to fund the dig site another ten more years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.32,0:57:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你相信我 我知道我这样做很愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you have to believe me. This was a stupid decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.82,0:57:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是全出自于一片好意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did it with the best intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.33,0:57:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,出自一片好意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the best intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.83,0:57:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多最坏的情况 就是出自一片好意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the worst things imaginable have been done…with the best intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.34,0:58:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 依我看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, as far as I'm concerned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.84,0:58:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和建这个岛的人一样糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're no better than the people that built this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.36,0:58:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么 那些家伙就是为了蛋才追我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Those things are after us because of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.36,0:58:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那些家伙」知道我们有蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Those things" know we have the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.37,0:58:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算丢到河里去 它们仍会追我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drop them in the river, they'll still be after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.37,0:58:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,若抓到我们和蛋呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they catch us with 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.87,0:58:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,若抓到我们没有蛋呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they catch us without 'em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.88,0:58:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下游处有条船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a boat at the bottom, just downriver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.38,0:58:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽量逃到海边去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can try and make it to the coast, at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.74,0:59:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.24,0:59:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.75,0:59:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次先过一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this one at a time, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.79,1:00:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come on over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.30,1:00:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One at a time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.80,1:00:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 艾瑞克 我离开你一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Eric, I'm gonna leave you just for a minute, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.80,1:00:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在我后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're gonna be right behind me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.80,1:00:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 我一个人 待在给水车里八周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I've been alone in a water truck for eight weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.31,1:00:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟没有你 不会有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can manage the next two minutes without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.32,1:00:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们已经团圆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We're all together now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.85,1:01:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Over you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.85,1:01:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.38,1:02:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.39,1:02:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.39,1:02:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.39,1:02:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个鸟笼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a birdcage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.39,1:02:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鸟的笼子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.40,1:02:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.40,1:02:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.40,1:02:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric. Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.90,1:02:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.92,1:02:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see him! I can't see him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.92,1:02:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric! Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.93,1:02:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.96,1:03:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.47,1:03:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy? Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.97,1:03:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, stop. Billy, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.97,1:03:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.48,1:03:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.00,1:03:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 坚持下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric, hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.50,1:03:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.02,1:04:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.05,1:04:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.06,1:04:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.11,1:05:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克？他在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric? He's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.62,1:05:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.62,1:05:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿 在河那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! He's across the river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.62,1:05:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.63,1:05:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 比利怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, Eric. No, no. - What about Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.15,1:06:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy! Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.66,1:06:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.16,1:06:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.16,1:06:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.25,1:07:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有足够的汽油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty of gasoline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.25,1:07:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能到海边就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just gotta make our way to the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.75,1:08:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以发出信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work out some sort of a signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.76,1:08:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,生火或什么的 好让他们能看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Build a fire or something. Something they can see from the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.77,1:08:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.77,1:08:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eric, how you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.28,1:08:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去比利你一定很难过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.79,1:08:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我对他说的最后一句话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the last thing I said to him was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.29,1:08:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.79,1:08:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你和建这个岛的人一样糟」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You're as bad as the people that built this place."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.29,1:08:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是气话 他太年轻气盛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which wasn't true. Billy was just young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.80,1:08:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.30,1:08:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为男孩可分两类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a theory that there are two kinds of boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.30,1:08:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一类想成为天文学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are those that want to be astronomers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.81,1:08:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一类想做太空人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those that want to be astronauts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.81,1:08:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天文学家和古生物学家一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The astronomer, or the paleontologist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.80,1:09:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在完全安全的地方做研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets to study these amazing things from a place of complete safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.32,1:09:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜永远不能上太空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you never get to go into space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.82,1:09:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 差别就在想象和亲眼所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. That's the difference between imagining and seeing:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.33,1:09:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,并能亲手摸到它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be able to touch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.33,1:09:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是比利最渴望的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's… that's all that Billy wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.84,1:09:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.87,1:09:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士 你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know something, Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.87,1:10:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.90,1:10:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.42,1:10:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在挂断前快找到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find it before it stops ringing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.93,1:10:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 你留在船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eric, you stay on that boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.93,1:10:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 不对 是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here. Wait. Whoa-whoa, it's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.44,1:11:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.95,1:11:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.45,1:11:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可拥有位于瓜达拉哈市的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too can own a time-share…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.37,1:11:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,渡假别墅的共同所有权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in beautiful Guadalajara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.96,1:11:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,并在我们的四星级餐厅用餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy a meal in one of our four-star restaurants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.96,1:11:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.48,1:11:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下来的电池 只够我们打一通电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off the power. You've got juice for maybe one call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.49,1:11:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别打给美国大使馆 他们什么事也不做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do, don't call the U.S. Embassy. They won't do a damn thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.49,1:11:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们过来看呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys! Come here! Look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.00,1:12:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲣鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonitos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.50,1:12:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们被吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something must have spooked them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.00,1:12:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比 别让引擎停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the engine going, Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.01,1:12:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把节流阀打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the throttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.52,1:12:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up, pick up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.03,1:12:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.53,1:12:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.03,1:12:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.53,1:12:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.04,1:12:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 把电话拿给妈咪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie! Take the phone to Mommy now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.54,1:12:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把电话拿给妈咪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, take the phone to Mommy now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.54,1:12:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恐龙先生打来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the dinosaur man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.54,1:12:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.55,1:12:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.05,1:12:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 有没有把电话给妈咪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, are you taking the phone to Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.55,1:12:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.58,1:13:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈 大家好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ho-ho. Hi, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.59,1:13:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真不错 你们好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great to be here! Hi, there! How are you today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.11,1:13:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会很棒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.62,1:14:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁打来的？- 恐龙先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's on the phone? - The dinosaur man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.12,1:14:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 阿伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is? Alan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.13,1:14:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找看盒子里有没有武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in the boxes! Find a weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.14,1:14:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话呢？快去接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the phone? There! Get the phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.65,1:14:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie? Ellie, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.65,1:14:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用手机吗 我听不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan, are you on a cell phone? I can't hear you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.65,1:14:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,B地的河流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The river! Site "B"! The river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.16,1:14:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.27,1:16:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.28,1:17:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.29,1:17:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.30,1:17:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul, you jerk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.80,1:17:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能就这样走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave me like this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.31,1:17:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没走呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.32,1:17:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得几年前的夏天 我们去钓鱼吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when we went fishing a couple summers ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.33,1:17:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我把船卸下来时 拖车反而沉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was putting the boat in the water, and the trailer sank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.33,1:17:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖吊车想把车拉上来 自己反而越陷越深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tow truck tried to pull us out, and it got dragged in too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.34,1:18:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,气得司机差点揍我一顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truck driver wanted to knock my lights out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.35,1:18:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想念钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss fishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.35,1:18:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kirby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.86,1:18:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找的那位女士… 她是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That lady you called. Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.86,1:18:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真能帮我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that she can help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.36,1:18:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我唯一能信任的人 我欠她太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the one person I could always count on. I owe her a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.87,1:18:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜一直没对她说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I don't think I ever told her that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.87,1:18:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.87,1:18:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. You hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.88,1:18:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海洋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ocean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.91,1:19:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们向我们要蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want the eggs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.41,1:19:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们早死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise we'd be dead already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.92,1:19:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家蹲下来 它在向我们挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get down. She's challenging us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.44,1:19:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它以为你偷了蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks you stole the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.95,1:19:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我后面去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.97,1:19:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把蛋给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.99,1:20:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 快给它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.01,1:20:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 要发求救信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no, no. Call for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.56,1:21:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a helicopter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.07,1:21:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant? Dr. Alan Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.58,1:21:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.58,1:21:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样太危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a very bad idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.09,1:22:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要好好谢她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You have to thank her now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.09,1:22:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,连海军和海军陆战队都出动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sent the navy and the marines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.10,1:22:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 你真是救命恩人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you, Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.61,1:22:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士 这个人是和你一起来的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, this man with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.61,1:22:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.12,1:22:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.63,1:22:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.13,1:22:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你的帽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rescued your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.13,1:22:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士 我们得起飞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, we need to go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.63,1:22:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 是呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.64,1:22:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是挺重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the important thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.14,1:22:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.14,1:22:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你坐下来 系上安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you to sit here and buckle up, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.65,1:23:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,海影对尘暴 一共援救了五人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea Shadow Dust Storm Zero Five, six souls on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.66,1:23:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尘暴对海影 知道了 干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dust Storm Sea Shadow, roger. Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.66,1:23:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.67,1:23:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,格兰特博士 你快看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grant, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.18,1:23:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们要飞到哪里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think they' re going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.68,1:23:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 也许去找新地方筑巢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe just looking for new nesting grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.18,1:23:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他们来说外面是全新的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a whole new world for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.19,1:23:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想到俄克拉荷马州来筑巢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dare 'em to nest in Enid, Oklahoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.20,1:23:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.{\r}
